Vintage style illustration of a bubbling cauldron in a medieval alchemist's workshop, steam rising from a thick soup containing floating geometric shapes - JSON curly braces carved into wooden blocks, XML angle brackets as metal fragments, and tangled query strings as noodles. The cauldron sits on an ornate iron stand over crackling flames, surrounded by scattered parchments with technical diagrams, dusty bottles filled with colorful data particles, and brass measuring instruments. Warm amber candlelight illuminates the scene, casting long shadows across a worn wooden workbench. The atmosphere suggests careful experimentation mixing incompatible ingredients, with a hint of controlled chaos. Aged sepia tones dominate, with pops of deep blue and gold accents typical of Renaissance-era scientific illustrations.
